<title>BAHRAIN: Saudi treasury bills mixed.</title>
<headline>Saudi treasury bills mixed.</headline>
<dateline>MANAMA 1996-10-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Yields were mixed at this week's offering of Saudi treasury bills worth three billion riyals to local banks by the Saudi Arabian Monetary Agency, a banker said on Monday</p>
<p>The yield on 28-day bills was steady at 5.2952 percent, while the rate on the 91-day paper fell to 5.3612 from 5.4360 percent a week earlier. The 190-day bills were unchanged at 5.5444 percent.</p>
<p>Prices were at 99.58984, 98.64844 and 97.25887 respectively.</p>
<p>One-month interbank rates were steady at 5-7/16, 5/16 percent,three months were at 5-9/16, 7/16 percent and six months were at 5-11/16, 9/16.</p>
</text>
